cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "labcurve: clean, summarise, fit and plot experimental measurements"
abstract: >-
  A small command-line tool and Python library that cleans CSV files of
  experimental measurements, computes descriptive statistics, fits a model
  with parameter uncertainties and optional robust outlier rejection, and
  produces a figure and a machine-readable report.
